flowchart TD
    A[User submits booking form] --> B{User logged in?}
    B -- No --> C[Return 401 login required]
    B -- Yes --> D[Validate car, locations and dates]
    D --> E{Dates and inputs valid?}
    E -- No --> F[Return 400 validation error]
    E -- Yes --> G[Begin JDBC transaction]
    G --> H[Lock active car row]
    H --> I{Car exists and is active?}
    I -- No --> J[Roll back and return 404]
    I -- Yes --> K[Check overlapping confirmed bookings]
    K --> L{Overlap found?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Roll back and return 409]
    L -- No --> N[Calculate total and insert booking]
    N --> O[Commit transaction]
    O --> P[Return saved booking]
